# Community Drumming at Ocean St World Festival

Drummers, dancers and lovers of rhythm. This year there will be community drumming at the Ocean Street World Festival. There will be a dress theme for those that are drumming and you will find out more in class. This is a fantastic music festival with lots to see, eat and do on Easter Sunday! More information on the festival including program times can be found [here](http://oceanstreetworldfestival.com.au/ "Ocean St World Music Festival"). Come and join in the fun! All beginners and experienced drummers are welcome to come, and of course there will be Dance Coop rhythms for those that are dancing. We will wrap up the night with a serious boogie to the Hayden Hack Infusion......... look forward to seeing you all there!
